{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And Jacob sent... Thus you shall say to my lord, to Esau.</b> And because he called him 'adon' he was punished. The Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: I said ״ורב יעבוד צעיר״, and you called him 'adon' eight times — for so you find in the parashah. By your life, eight kings from Esau shall rule before a king rules over Israel. And that is what is written at the end of the parashah: ״ואלה המלכים אשר מלכו בארץ אדום לפני מלך לבני ישראל״."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:22.964267073Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}